.TH CI_SET_LOCAL_IP4 3 "30 June 2010"
.SH NAME
ci_set_local_ip4 \- Set local IPv4 address outgoing requests.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <ci.h>

void ci_set_local_ip4(ci_channel_t *\fIchannel\fP, unsigned int \fIlocal_ip\fP)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBci_set_local_ip4\fP function sets the IP address for outbound
requests.  The parameter \fIlocal_ip\fP is specified in host byte order.  This
allows users to specify outbound interfaces when used on multi-homed systems.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ci_set_local_ip6 (3)
.SH NOTES
This function was added in c-ci 1.7.4
